type: software
title: "LENA: Grounded Multilingual Local-Referral Prototype"
abstract: >-
  Research prototype for multilingual access to curated local support services
  in Leipzig, with constrained language-model interpretation and formulation,
  deterministic candidate selection, grounding, and optional speech interfaces.
